    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183640/extras/a1778711116728a2b58d20677e7182bc.poster.avif?t=1752600861\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183640/extras/a1778711116728a2b58d20677e7182bc.webm?t=1752600861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183640/extras/a1778711116728a2b58d20677e7182bc.mp4?t=1752600861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to challenge the forces of darkness?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather your team, upgrade your gear, and embark on a deadly adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat the Demon Lords and seal the portal before it\u2019s too late!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183640/extras/f54e1a801476ec2e3a432679adcff3be.poster.avif?t=1752600861\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183640/extras/f54e1a801476ec2e3a432679adcff3be.webm?t=1752600861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183640/extras/f54e1a801476ec2e3a432679adcff3be.mp4?t=1752600861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An ancient evil has awakened in the kingdom. Demons have taken over the royal castle and stolen a magical amulet that keeps the portal to otherworldly realms sealed. Without it, darkness will consume the world\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183640/extras/473d37d12d102b3372659c4b95cb03df.poster.avif?t=1752600861\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183640/extras/473d37d12d102b3372659c4b95cb03df.webm?t=1752600861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183640/extras/473d37d12d102b3372659c4b95cb03df.mp4?t=1752600861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But hope is not lost! The legendary Demon Hunters send their bravest warriors to fight against the forces of evil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183640/extras/474d2b839efd91b0d846efca6fac2cfe.poster.avif?t=1752600861\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183640/extras/474d2b839efd91b0d846efca6fac2cfe.webm?t=1752600861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183640/extras/474d2b839efd91b0d846efca6fac2cfe.mp4?t=1752600861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc79 <strong>What awaits you?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-paced combat</strong> against bandits, pirates, zombies, skeletons, and demons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose your hero</strong> \u2013 a fearless knight,  a young wizard, or a daring pirate girl.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character progression</strong> \u2013 upgrade your armor, weapons, and magical artifacts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dungeons</strong> \u2013 16 levels full of dangers, traps, and treasures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic boss battles</strong> \u2013 face off against powerful demon overlords.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging storyline</strong> \u2013 complete quests, find allies, and uncover the mysteries of the cursed castle. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183640/extras/49629a4569fc038c73817545887725ac.avif?t=1752600861\" width=616 height=196 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183640/extras/a1778711116728a2b58d20677e7182bc.poster.avif?t=1752600861\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183640/extras/a1778711116728a2b58d20677e7182bc.webm?t=1752600861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183640/extras/a1778711116728a2b58d20677e7182bc.mp4?t=1752600861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to challenge the forces of darkness?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather your team, upgrade your gear, and embark on a deadly adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat the Demon Lords and seal the portal before it\u2019s too late!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183640/extras/f54e1a801476ec2e3a432679adcff3be.poster.avif?t=1752600861\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183640/extras/f54e1a801476ec2e3a432679adcff3be.webm?t=1752600861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183640/extras/f54e1a801476ec2e3a432679adcff3be.mp4?t=1752600861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An ancient evil has awakened in the kingdom. Demons have taken over the royal castle and stolen a magical amulet that keeps the portal to otherworldly realms sealed. Without it, darkness will consume the world\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183640/extras/473d37d12d102b3372659c4b95cb03df.poster.avif?t=1752600861\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183640/extras/473d37d12d102b3372659c4b95cb03df.webm?t=1752600861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183640/extras/473d37d12d102b3372659c4b95cb03df.mp4?t=1752600861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But hope is not lost! The legendary Demon Hunters send their bravest warriors to fight against the forces of evil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183640/extras/474d2b839efd91b0d846efca6fac2cfe.poster.avif?t=1752600861\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183640/extras/474d2b839efd91b0d846efca6fac2cfe.webm?t=1752600861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183640/extras/474d2b839efd91b0d846efca6fac2cfe.mp4?t=1752600861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc79 <strong>What awaits you?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-paced combat</strong> against bandits, pirates, zombies, skeletons, and demons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose your hero</strong> \u2013 a fearless knight,  a young wizard, or a daring pirate girl.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character progression</strong> \u2013 upgrade your armor, weapons, and magical artifacts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dungeons</strong> \u2013 16 levels full of dangers, traps, and treasures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic boss battles</strong> \u2013 face off against powerful demon overlords.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging storyline</strong> \u2013 complete quests, find allies, and uncover the mysteries of the cursed castle. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183640/extras/49629a4569fc038c73817545887725ac.avif?t=1752600861\" width=616 height=196 /></span></p>",
